### Health
GET http://localhost:4000/health

### Dishes
GET http://localhost:4000/api/dishes

### Create order (replace dish_id if needed)
POST http://localhost:4000/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dish_id": 1,
  "cook_temp_c": 75,
  "cook_time_min": 20,
  "hygiene_ok": true
}

### Recent orders
GET http://localhost:4000/api/orders

### Public order
# Copy the token from qr_url in the create-order response.
GET http://localhost:5173/o/REPLACE_TOKEN
